    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Immortal Hero Lost in the Past</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a Hero who has lost his memory falls into a world of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he wields tremendous power, he cannot recall who he once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the weapon in his hand is strangely familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must press forward to uncover the reason he arrived in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Hero Who Grows Stronger with Every Death</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero's journey in this world is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formidable enemies block his path, yet with every death, the Hero grows even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering his controls through repeated challenges and harnessing new powers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he is destined to become the savior of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>An Unbelievable Ally: The Jar with a Gigantic Mouth</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Jar guides his path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems to know everything, though its purpose remains elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonetheless, it proves to be a steadfast companion in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will following its guidance truly lead to salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In Pursuit of the World's Secrets with a Witch</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Witch has bestowed upon the Hero unexpected immortal power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the Hero dies, she grants him even greater strength,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gradually revealing the hidden truths of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, as you listen to the tales of the Jar and the Witch,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you begin to realize that this world is far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of this world rests on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you believe in here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure and witness the truth with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decision may determine the destiny of this world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Immortal Hero Lost in the Past</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a Hero who has lost his memory falls into a world of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he wields tremendous power, he cannot recall who he once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the weapon in his hand is strangely familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, he must press forward to uncover the reason he arrived in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3585bc2efe663647e44ece6841cf9492.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Hero Who Grows Stronger with Every Death</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero's journey in this world is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formidable enemies block his path, yet with every death, the Hero grows even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering his controls through repeated challenges and harnessing new powers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he is destined to become the savior of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/a3226ed021c82c45a71ce93d18e05ec6.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>An Unbelievable Ally: The Jar with a Gigantic Mouth</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Jar guides his path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems to know everything, though its purpose remains elusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonetheless, it proves to be a steadfast companion in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will following its guidance truly lead to salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/3ca6742d290ec4c0d31acee4c3460ab7.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In Pursuit of the World's Secrets with a Witch</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Witch has bestowed upon the Hero unexpected immortal power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the Hero dies, she grants him even greater strength,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gradually revealing the hidden truths of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, as you listen to the tales of the Jar and the Witch,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you begin to realize that this world is far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.poster.avif?t=1744072776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.webm?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530600/extras/df019854d4a10b93157264c6d85841c8.mp4?t=1744072776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of this world rests on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you believe in here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure and witness the truth with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decision may determine the destiny of this world.</p>",
    "short_description": "RIM: Soul Jar is a hack and slash roguelite set in a world where medieval and futuristic elements mix. Become a warrior who has fallen into the past and embark on a journey to save the future with the Soul Jar. Cleanse dungeons of enemies and bosses, and set out to break the cycle of RIM.",
